    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"15908\" class=\"elementor elementor-15908\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9302a56 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-default-div e-5b8e314 \" data-id=\"9302a56\" data-element_type=\"e-flexbox\" data-e-type=\"e-flexbox\" data-interaction-id=\"9302a56\">\n    <div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6eda635 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6eda635\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b43918 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2b43918\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>WE AIM TO INSTIL IN EACH CHILD A SENSE OF INQUISITIVENESS, URGE FOR EXPERIMENTATION, OBSERVATION &amp; SYNTHESIS. EVERY CHILD IS ENCOURAGED TO INCULCATE THE VALUES OF CITIZENRY. WE ARE COMMITTED TO PROVIDE A POSITIVE LEARNING ENVIRONMENT TO BUILD A COMMUNITY OF CRITICAL THINKERS THAT ADVOCATES MENTAL TRANSFORMATION CREATING WISDOM AND HEALTHY BEHAVIOUR</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
